  "content": "<article class=\"gv-story gv-photo-video\"><header class=\"gv-intro\"><p class=\"gv-kicker\">Staten Island, New York · Sweet Sixteen photography &amp; film</p><h1>Julia<br><em>Island Chateau</em></h1><p class=\"gv-lede\">Julia’s Sweet Sixteen at Island Chateau, in a GioLina film and selected portrait.</p><nav class=\"gv-story-nav\" aria-label=\"Explore this wedding\"><a href=\"#wedding-film\">The film</a><a href=\"#wedding-photographs\">The photographs</a></nav></header><section id=\"wedding-film\" class=\"gv-film-section\" aria-label=\"Julia Sweet Sixteen film\"><div class=\"gv-film-heading\"><h2>The Sweet Sixteen film</h2></div><div class=\"gl-film-preview gv-film\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1280/854\"><img src=\"/assets/sweet-julia-photo.webp\" width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" alt=\"Julia, from the existing GioLina portfolio\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\"><button type=\"button\" data-mediazilla-src=\"https://mediazilla.com/8baRrhNAed\" data-film-title=\"Julia\" aria-label=\"Play Sweet Sixteen film, Julia\"><span>Play Sweet Sixteen film</span></button></div><p class=\"gv-caption\">Julia · A film by GioLina Films</p></section><section id=\"wedding-photographs\" class=\"gv-editorial\" aria-labelledby=\"gv-story-title\"><p class=\"gv-kicker\">Selected photographs</p><h2 id=\"gv-story-title\">A portrait of the celebration.</h2><p>Existing portraits from the GioLina Sweet Sixteen collection.</p></section><section class=\"gv-gallery\" aria-label=\"Selected photographs of Julia\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/sweet-julia-photo.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Julia, Sweet Sixteen portrait\"><img src=\"/assets/sweet-julia-photo.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/sweet-julia-photo.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Julia, Sweet Sixteen portrait\"></a><figcaption>Julia · selected portrait.</figcaption></figure></section><section class=\"gv-context\" aria-labelledby=\"gv-context-title\"><div><p class=\"gv-kicker\">The setting · Staten Island</p><h2 id=\"gv-context-title\">Island Chateau</h2></div><div><p>Island Chateau is a Staten Island event venue. This story features Julia’s celebration. GioLina provided both photography and cinematography.</p><a class=\"gv-text-link\" href=\"https://www.islandchateau.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Visit the venue website</a></div></section><div class=\"gv-collection-link\"><a href=\"/sweet-sixteen/\">View the Sweet Sixteen collection</a></div><section class=\"gv-inquire\" aria-labelledby=\"gv-inquire-title\"><h2 id=\"gv-inquire-title\">Your Sweet Sixteen at Island Chateau</h2><p>Share your date, venue and the coverage you have in mind.</p><a class=\"gv-button\" href=\"/contact/\">Inquire about your Sweet Sixteen</a><div class=\"gv-links\"><a href=\"/sweet-sixteen/\">Explore Sweet Sixteen films & photographs</a></div></section><section class=\"gv-next\" aria-labelledby=\"gv-next-title\"><p class=\"gv-kicker\">Explore more Sweet Sixteen stories</p><h2 id=\"gv-next-title\"><a href=\"/sweet-sixteen/arianas-south/\">Gianna at Ariana’s South</a></h2></section></article><script src=\"/photography-viewer.js\" defer></script><script src=\"/mediazilla-player.js\" defer></script>"
